Table cell padding must be a space

```
|	a |	b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>	a</td><td>	b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| 	a | 	b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>	a</td><td>	b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|	 a |	 b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>	 a</td><td>	 b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a	| b	|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a	</td><td>b	</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a 	| b 	|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a 	</td><td>b 	</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|=	h |=	i |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>	h</th><th>	i</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|=	 h |=	 i |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>	 h</th><th>	 i</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|= h	|= i	|
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>h	</th><th>i	</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|= h 	|= i 	|
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>h 	</th><th>i 	</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
|	--- |	--- |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>	—</td><td>	—</td></tr>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| 	--- | 	--- |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>	—</td><td>	—</td></tr>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| ---	| ---	|
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>—	</td><td>—	</td></tr>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
|	^ | c |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>	^</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| c |	< |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>	&lt;</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
+	x | y |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a 	x</td><td>b y</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
+ x	| y	|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a x	</td><td>b y	</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
+ x | y |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a x</td><td>b y</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|=h|=  i |
|a|  b  |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>h</th><th>i</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| --- | ---: |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>a</th><th style="text-align: right;">b</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td style="text-align: right;">2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| ^ | c |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td rowspan="2">a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| c | < |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td colspan="2">c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
